<view class="settingsScreen" style="--nav-height:{{navHeight}}px;--font-scale:{{fontScale}}"><nav-bar pinned="{{true}}" title="玩法设置" back="{{true}}" />
 <view class="pixelPaper settingsCard"><text class="settingsTitle">鼠队视野共享</text><view class="settingsSwitch"><text>{{mouseTeamVision?'已开启':'已关闭'}}</text><switch checked="{{mouseTeamVision}}" disabled="{{!editable || saving}}" bindchange="toggle" color="#477f60" aria-label="鼠队视野共享" /></view><text class="settingsCopy">开启：任一存活鼠发现120米内的猫，全体存活鼠可看到这只猫的地图标记。</text><text class="settingsCopy">关闭：维持本人附近有猫的预警，不展示猫的精确位置。</text><text class="settingsCopy">仅追逐阶段生效；失去视野或位置超过5秒未更新，猫标记移除。被捕、退出和暂停时不共享。</text><text class="settingsNote">视野由定位距离判断，不检测建筑遮挡。120米为试点参数，尚未验证平衡。</text></view>
 <view class="pixelPaper settingsCard"><text class="settingsTitle">赛后行动轨迹</text><text class="settingsCopy">本轮躲藏与追逐阶段，每2秒最多记录一个有效定位点；暂停、出局、退出和结束后不再记录。</text><text class="settingsCopy">每人可导出本人，房主可在结算后导出全员。轨迹保留7天；断网或定位缺失处留空，不补画路线。本人海报可含速度和时间对齐的近猫距离摘要，只标注本人点。</text></view>
 <text class="settingsNote">{{notice || '正在读取设置…'}}</text><button wx:if="{{editable}}" class="saveSettings" bindtap="save" disabled="{{saving || loading}}" loading="{{saving}}">保存设置</button><button wx:if="{{error}}" class="textButton" bindtap="load">重新读取</button><text wx:if="{{error}}" class="settingsError" role="alert">{{error}}</text>
</view>
